trivia
======

This product bundles third-party material listed below. The licenses of
each are reproduced or linked.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (ONNX port)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The trivia binary embeds the ONNX weights and tokenizer files for the
sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model, in the form distributed by
the Qdrant/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-onnx repository on the Hugging Face Hub:

  https://huggingface.co/Qdrant/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-onnx

Both the original model and the ONNX port are distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The files are bundled verbatim with no modifications. Files included:

  - model.onnx
  - tokenizer.json
  - config.json
  - special_tokens_map.json
  - tokenizer_config.json
